Z||000000||kempo||10-17-2001||02:59 PM||||I am looking into buying a set of rims.  They will be 17x7 5-100/114.3 40.<BR>My situation is that I don't want to buy rims and get tires for it, and as a result have the height of the fiero increased.  To do this, I'd have to get a smaller tire, right?  So if I get a smaller tire for a bigger rim, it should equal out?  Now, what size tires should I get for the wheels?  I think I'm going to get Z-Rated tires, but just need to know the size, or if this is even practical at all.  Thanks for the help!<P>-Kemp||||reg||1
