Z||000023||Rick 88||10-22-2001||12:02 AM||||kempo<P>I have 215/45/17's on the front of my 88. Wheels are 17x7.5 .40 offset. I have good clearance and the front is about 1 inch lower than stock. I'm pretty sure 225's would fit on mine but on a pre 88 the tires are pulled in more. It would be nice if a tire shop would mount one up for you. <P>I'm running 245/45/17 on the rear and have no clearance problems nor do they stick out. I have head 245's might hit the struts on pre 88's. 235/45/17's do not seem to be a problem.<P>Rick 88||||reg||3
